---
import ToolPage from '../../../layouts/ToolPage.astro';

const steps = [
  'Paste your JSON on the left, for example an API response you copied from the browser’s Network tab. Or click <strong>Try an example</strong>.',
  'Pick a name for the main type and choose <code>interface</code> or <code>type</code>. If some items in a list are missing a field, that field is marked optional for you.',
  'Copy the TypeScript types, the Zod schema or the tidied JSON. Or copy the prompt and paste it into Claude Code, Cursor or Codex so your agent adds the types to your project.',
];

const faq = [
  { q: 'Is my JSON sent anywhere?', a: 'No. The types are worked out in your browser. Your JSON never leaves your computer, so it’s safe to paste real API responses.' },
  { q: 'How does it know a field is optional?', a: 'When your JSON has a list of objects, it looks at every item. A field that’s missing from some items gets a <code>?</code> (or <code>.optional()</code> in Zod). Tick <strong>Make every field optional</strong> if you want that for all fields.' },
  { q: 'Should I use interface or type?', a: 'Either works for API data. <code>interface</code> is the common choice for objects and gives slightly clearer error messages. Pick <code>type</code> if your project already uses it, so the code looks the same everywhere.' },
  { q: 'What is Zod and why would I want it?', a: 'TypeScript types only exist while you write code. Zod checks the data when your app actually runs, so if an API sends something unexpected you get a clear error instead of a blank screen. Run <code>npm install zod</code>, paste the schema, and call <code>UserSchema.parse(data)</code>.' },
  { q: 'Why is a field typed as null or unknown[]?', a: 'The tool only knows what’s in your sample. If a field is always <code>null</code>, or a list is empty, it can’t tell what goes there. Paste a sample where that field has a real value, or change the type by hand.' },
  { q: 'It says my JSON has an error. What do I do?', a: 'The message gives the line and column and says what’s wrong in plain words, like a missing comma, an extra comma at the end of a list, or single quotes instead of double quotes. Fix that spot and the types appear right away.' },
];
---
<ToolPage
  slug="json-to-typescript"
  title="JSON to TypeScript: interfaces, types and Zod schema · Darnly"
  description="Paste JSON and get TypeScript interfaces or types and a Zod schema, with optional fields found for you and errors in plain words. Free and private."
  h1="JSON to TypeScript: types and Zod schema from any JSON"
  lede="Paste JSON, like an API response, and get TypeScript types and a Zod schema you can drop into your project. It runs in your browser, so nothing is uploaded."
  steps={steps}
  faq={faq}
>
  <div class="jt">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="side">
        <div class="head">
          <label for="jt-input" class="lab">Your JSON</label>
          <div class="head-btns">
            <button id="jt-example" type="button" class="ghost">Try an example</button>
            <button id="jt-clear" type="button" class="ghost">Clear</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <textarea id="jt-input" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" placeholder='{ "id": 1, "name": "Ada", "tags": ["admin"] }'></textarea>
        <p class="status" id="jt-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="error" id="jt-error" role="alert" hidden>
          <p id="jt-error-msg"></p>
          <pre id="jt-error-snippet"></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="side">
        <div class="options">
          <label class="name">Main type name <input id="jt-root" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="Root" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" /></label>
          <fieldset class="seg">
            <legend class="sr">Write as</legend>
            <label><input type="radio" name="jt-style" value="interface" checked /> interface</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="jt-style" value="type" /> type</label>
          </fieldset>
          <label class="check"><input id="jt-optional" type="checkbox" /> Make every field optional</label>
          <label class="check"><input id="jt-readonly" type="checkbox" /> Readonly</label>
        </div>

        <div class="result" id="jt-result" hidden>
          <div class="code">
            <div class="code-head">
              <div class="tabs" id="jt-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Output">
                <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="ts" aria-selected="true">TypeScript</button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="zod" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Zod</button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="json" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Formatted JSON</button>
              </div>
              <button id="jt-copy" type="button" class="copy">Copy</button>
            </div>
            <pre id="jt-code" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0"></pre>
          </div>
          <button id="jt-prompt" type="button" class="primary">Copy prompt for your AI agent</button>
        </div>
        <p class="empty" id="jt-empty">Your types show up here as soon as you paste JSON.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</ToolPage>

<script>
  import '../../../scripts/json-to-typescript';
</script>

<style>
  .jt { min-width: 0; }
  .jt [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 28px; align-items: start; }
  .side { display: grid; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }
  .head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .lab { font-weight: 600; }
  .head-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .ghost { font: 600 14px/1 var(--body); padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }
  .ghost:hover { border-color: var(--sky); }
  textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 420px; font: 400 13px/1.6 var(--mono); font-variant-ligatures: none; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); resize: vertical; tab-size: 2; }
  textarea:focus { outline: 3px solid var(--pink); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .status { margin: 0; min-height: 1.6em; font-size: 14px; color: #1E7A4C; }
  .status:empty { display: none; }
  .error { padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FDEEF4; color: #8A1A3D; min-width: 0; }
  .error p { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
  .error pre { margin: 8px 0 0; font: 400 13px/1.5 var(--mono); white-space: pre; overflow-x: auto; color: var(--ink); }
  .options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px 18px; }
  .name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
  .name input { width: 140px; font: 400 15px/1.2 var(--mono); padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); }
  .seg { display: inline-flex; margin: 0; padding: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--white); }
  .seg label { position: relative; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; font: 500 14px/1.2 var(--mono); cursor: pointer; }
  .seg label:has(input:checked) { background: var(--sky); color: var(--white); }
  .seg label:has(input:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid var(--pink); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .seg input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
  .check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 15px; }
  .result { display: grid; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }
  .result:not([hidden]) + .empty { display: none; }
  .empty { margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; border: 2px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--wash); color: var(--ink-soft); text-align: center; }
  .code { border-radius: 16px; background: var(--ink); color: #D9EEF6; overflow: hidden; min-width: 0; }
  .code-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(217, 238, 246, 0.12); }
  .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
  .tabs button { font: 500 13px/1 var(--mono); padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #8FB4C4; cursor: pointer; }
  .tabs button[aria-selected='true'] { background: rgba(252, 255, 255, 0.14); color: var(--white); }
  .copy { font: 600 13px/1 var(--body); padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 0; background: var(--sky); color: var(--white); cursor: pointer; }
  .code pre { margin: 0; padding: 16px; max-height: 520px; overflow: auto; font: 400 13px/1.7 var(--mono); font-variant-ligatures: none; }
  .primary { justify-self: start; font: 600 15px/1 var(--body); padding: 13px 20px; border-radius: 999px; border: 0; background: var(--pink); color: var(--white); cursor: pointer; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    textarea { min-height: 240px; }
  }
</style>
